editor_description = "Zylann's HTerrain demo island (godot_hterrain_demo), carried from Godot 3 and retextured in snow and rock. Shifted so its flattest high ground, (176, 280) on the map, is this scene's origin. Its collision is on the Terrain layer too, which is all SnowDeformation's raycast ground looks at, so the snow lies on the hills and not on the Player or the props."
